{
 "name": "full_warm",
 "description": "Continued (full) run warm-started from the pilot: all 12 languages, about 8,000 h of audio processed at the default TRAIN_HOURS. Shares are pinned per sampling group: the 8 new languages (bn, te, ml 9% each; pa 8%; mr, gu, or, ur 7.5% each) 65%, a refresher for hi 4.5%, ta 5%, kn 6.5% (slightly upweighted) and en 4% (20%), and code-mixed-only streams 15%. Shares are of drawn rows; by hours the refresher is about 22% and code-mixed rows about 15% (docs/PLAN.md). Kathbath read speech has weight 2 inside each new language and 1.5 inside hi/ta/kn. Licence-verified sources only: IndicVoices, Kathbath, Vaani-transcription-part, LibriSpeech, People's Speech (CC BY), VoxPopuli. Shrutilipi is left out (gated, this account has no access, so its rows are unverified; no teacher-CER filter); MUCS and SPRING-INX stay eval-only (licence review); Common Voice is blocked. Kathbath transcripts go through the loanword normaliser (docs/loanwords.md).",
 "seed": 0,
 "min_seconds": 0.5,
 "max_seconds": 20.0,
 "dev": {
  "fraction": 0.01,
  "min_hours_per_lang": 0.5,
  "max_hours_per_lang": 1.0
 },
